7mOd"}},{"id":"7539916329575334687","text":"Thank you so much. I ask after the call. I told him needed time to think about it. He got aggressive. I’m just trying to help my son.","createdAt":"2025-08-18T13:26:29.000Z","likes":9,"replyCount":2,"language":"en","author":{"handle":"diinr20","displayName":"DIINR20","avatarUrl":"https://p16-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/musically-maliva-obj/1594805258216454~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=c043984f&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=N6aGIRwjGaTIxlykkM%2FXo5BweKM%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8","platformUserId":"7122301647804220462","secUid":"MS4wLjABAAAAfm93JG7Dn7WHFKbvZ-yVJKkkdEzyxFkLo2ej0DaNC4Q6DLF1malWNmrEFcnOQWrx"}},{"id":"7527417423805694751","text":"These guys kept calling me before we went to the University of Oregon camp, trying to “Leverage” our visit for a price I’m sure. My son and I did our own work and introduced ourselves to the coaches and gathered all their contact information. Even got a selfie with Head Coach Dan Lanning","createdAt":"2025-07-15T21:04:21.000Z","likes":8,"replyCount":1,"language":"en","author":{"handle":"dstrong797","displayName":"dstrong797","avatarUrl":"https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast5-avt-0068-tx/7350081539318743086~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:100:100.jpg?dr=9640&refresh_token=c7e79c6c&x-expires=1794067200&x-signature=tHHNGo72grmYziG86G0dl91%2FyMk%3D&t=4d5b0474&ps=13740610&shp=30310797&shcp=ff37627b&idc=useast8","platformUserId":"6817656947450463238","secUid":"MS4wLjABAAAAJqinLn_Es7LkiVUkNnqwOneF4mt4ghlPtQ8C3slHZHru0F-ehrgr5FR3-uyU4t29"}},{"id":"7704542405998936845","text":"what is another free program or website to update information to get recruited for volleyball","createdAt":"2026-11-05T04:39:54.000Z","likes":0,"replyCount":0,"language":"en","author":{"handle":"mmmaritza92","displayName":"Maritza","avatarUrl":"https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast5-avt-0068-tx/1ec320cb3a2576c76a4168fa6c60e541~tplv